amstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595540/extras/86656e9ad736ebdeec50e9fa41b1799b.avif?t=1745662032\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595540/extras/d84c751a73d67ec64972f0a06e6028a2.poster.avif?t=1745662032\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595540/extras/d84c751a73d67ec64972f0a06e6028a2.webm?t=1745662032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595540/extras/d84c751a73d67ec64972f0a06e6028a2.mp4?t=1745662032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595540/extras/377c28c175f44d0fe3b05ed254b1caff.avif?t=1745662032\" width=600 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595540/extras/1f39e661d2fdefd5862127723171f4ec.poster.avif?t=1745662032\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595540/extras/1f39e661d2fdefd5862127723171f4ec.webm?t=1745662032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595540/extras/1f39e661d2fdefd5862127723171f4ec.mp4?t=1745662032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behold UBERSLAUGHTER Inc., a corporation whose sole purpose is inter-dimensional pest control. Their methods are simple: send an agent to allegedly safeguard the local populace, contain those hellish anomalies and obliterate them to a pulp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Reapin Randy, a dimension-hopping drugged-up bloodthirsty maniac with questionable ethics, tasked with neutralizing these high-priority targets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Be a carnage artist. Master your movement. Refine your arsenal and martial skills.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Encounter a multitude of NPCs with diverse backgrounds, stories, and personalities\u2014some victims, others perpetrators of crimes against humanity.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amass copious amounts of money to upgrade your weapons, enhance your abilities, and purchase inter-dimensional drugs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Replay levels to perfect your time and score, becoming a relentless force against the onslaught.  <br>   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an adrenaline-fueled, survival FPS where your skill expression shapes inter-dimensional warfare. Will you emerge victorious, or succumb to the relentless waves of foes? UBERSLAUGHTER awaits you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: All displayed features, art and screenshots might be changed or modified in the future, as the game is in development.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Losing your virginity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2595540/e7ea7a3316a52ce4c0ff7e30404d5098e47c390b.jpg"},{"name":"Can't find me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2595540/b41a856aa7490e3429461b3ad720bfbe02674912.jpg"},{"name":"Oligarch Grindset","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2595540/16fb74b734c38d1abac438865639a6e60d8a77c9.jpg"},{"name":"Feet Enjoyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2595540/5c5eeb840d9a94e32c036334f0f69b624b8afaa5.jpg"},{"name":"MLG","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2595540/8747d626fb118481412bcbe87e6ead29adbee048.jpg"},{"name":"Identity Theft","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2595540/42751a841863db0aa501e9b5b4b2154dc6e5c26f.jpg"},{"name":"Demi-God","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2595540/8e729f4616ef051ba14cc45ea4b39f1af3e70796.jpg"},{"name":"Penta-chin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2595540/704b11ab5c92ad20b41628a73e3037d3f362d120.jpg"},{"name":"Kill Big Baz","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2595540/68fa4180190391a915d13184359aa0d1e8e884d1.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2595540?t=1745662032","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745662032","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595540/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745662032","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595540/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745662032","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"All of the following are depicted in low resolution and low quality graphics and textures, as per the style of the game.\r\n\r\nThe player's will be able to fight many different types of enemies throughout the game. The fighting may include exaggerated gore such as headshots with heads exploding, dismemberment, blood effects from physical hits and weapon hits, explosions with blood effects. \r\n\r\nSome sexual connotations and innuendos in some dialogues. \r\nThere is no full nudity. \r\nThe main protagonist that the player plays has the ability to use drugs throughout the game. The drugs are fictional/invented in accordance with the theme of the game, albeit some might seem similar to real life drugs. \r\nThe player also has the option to kill non-playable characters throughout the game, whether they are innocent or not. \r\nThe game tackles some satirical/dark comedy themes that may be a critique on real life themes such as politics, culture, technology, art and social dynamics.\r\n\r\nThroughout the game, there may be depictions of socio-cultural problems between fictional races, species and cultures.\r\n"},"demos":[{"appid":2931380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>UBERSLAUGHTER </i></strong> transforms into a heart-pounding survival experience, where you must endure relentless waves of enemies in a retro, trippy, dimension-hopping adventure. Brace yourself for an intense FPS journey filled with gore, action, and the occasional cute animal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595540/extras/0379d7a1972e97bb69a5c51d14b1f90d.poster.avif?t=1745662032\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595540/extras/0379d7a1972e97bb69a5c51d14b1f90d.webm?t=1745662032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595540/extras/0379d7a1972e97bb69a5c51d14b1f90d.mp4?t=1745662032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595540/extras/e79ff294ee7096ec39a4b9e81bd07681.avif?t=1745662032\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_c